@@ -3,3 +3,21 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory rental desk:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`: `kind` is `'board'` or `'sail'`; `dailyPrice` is an integer
+  number of euro cents.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })`: returns `{ itemId, start, end, total }`.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })`: returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`; throws if the item is not
+  free for the whole period.
+
+Times are ISO-8601 UTC strings (ending in `Z`) at midnight; `end` is the start of the day after the last
+rented day, so `2026-07-01T00:00:00Z` to `2026-07-03T00:00:00Z` is two days. Overlapping bookings of the
+same item are refused; back-to-back ones are fine. Booking ids are sequential (`booking-1`, ...) so the
+service is deterministic. Cancellation (no refund under 24 hours before the start, full refund otherwise)
+is not implemented yet.
+
+Run the tests with `npm test`.
